Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.util.function.IntUnaryOperator;
public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    int offset = 3;
    IntUnaryOperator shift = x -> x + offset;
    System.out.println(shift.applyAsInt(4));
  }
}
```

